B.a1R=new A.ea("This app is for recording and sharing animal sightings in the Moremi area. The map shows sightings from all users from the last seven days only \u2014 older points roll off automatically, even if you stay offline, based on the date recorded for each sighting.\n\nSign in with your username and password (you can create an account on first launch). Your profile lists every sighting you have submitted while signed in (including older than seven days once it has synced). Submit queued sightings from your profile when you have signal.\n\nThe Water toggle loads the same latest Okavango water outline used on the monitoring map (internet required).",null,B.YK,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
